<title>UK: Natwest Markets appoints new research head.</title>
<headline>Natwest Markets appoints new research head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Natwest Markets said on Wednesday that it had appointed Edmond Warner as managing director and global head of its equities research division.</p>
<p>Warner joins Natwest from Dresdner Kleinwort Benson where he worked since 1993. His last job was as Kleinwort's head of global research.</p>
<p>Earlier, he was also the head of European research of Barings Securities Europe Ltd.</p>
<p>Warner will be based in London and will also take over the role of global strategist for Natwest markets</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
